			"name": "Archon's Mastery",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The ancient, scheming, well-fed tyrants of the Kabals: warlords who rule a city-district of Commorragh and have been fending off rivals for centuries. Codex: Drukhari's Archon background.\n\nDesign: 190 + 15 + 15 + 10 = 230 points, added to the baseline (145) for 375 points before estate, regrowth, Power from Pain, mental traits and skills.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
