					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Archon)",
					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target over the Drukhari Physiology baseline (no Keen Battle-Sense: an Archon's Per equals IQ): ST 12, DX 18, IQ 15, HT 12, Per 15, Will 17, Move 10. ST +2 (B14, 20), DX +4 (B15, 80), IQ +3 (B16, 60), HT +2 (B15, 20), Will +2 (B16, 10): 190 points.",
