					"id": "t-2QCu73lvNrW1vQH",
					"name": "Wealth (Very Wealthy)",
					"reference": "B25",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Kabal's plunder flows to its Archon.\n\nDesign: Very Wealthy (B25, 30 points).",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Social",
						"Xenos",
