					"name": "Status 4",
					"reference": "B28",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An Archon sits above thousands of Kabalites and slaves and answers to few in Commorragh.\n\nDesign: Status 4 (B28, 5/level, 20 points).",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Social",
